@startuml
title OAuth redirect round-trip with sessionStorage relay

actor User
participant "_authenticated\nbeforeLoad" as Guard
participant "login.tsx\nhandleOAuth" as Login
participant "sessionStorage\n(browser tab)" as SS
participant "OAuth Provider\n(GitHub / Google)" as Provider
participant "Gateway\nOAuthController" as GW
participant "oauth-handoff.tsx" as Handoff
participant "TanStack Router" as Router

User -> Guard: navigates to /catalog/abc
Guard -> Guard: isAuthenticated? → false
Guard -> Router: redirect to /login?redirect=/catalog/abc

User -> Login: clicks "Continue with GitHub"
Login -> SS: setItem('pendingRedirect', '/catalog/abc')
note right of SS: written only when\nredirectTo param is present
Login -> Provider: window.location.href = .../oauth/github/start\nnote right: full-page redirect exits SPA

Provider -> Provider: user authenticates
Provider -> GW: GET /api/auth/oauth/callback?code=...&state=...
GW -> GW: validate state\nexchange code for profile\nupsert user\nissue JWT cookie

GW -> Handoff: redirect to /oauth-handoff?code=...
activate Handoff

Handoff -> GW: GET /api/auth/oauth/callback?code=...
GW --> Handoff: 200 OK (JWT cookie set)

Handoff -> Handoff: queryClient.removeQueries({ queryKey: ['session'] })
Handoff -> SS: getItem('pendingRedirect') → '/catalog/abc'
Handoff -> SS: removeItem('pendingRedirect')
note right of SS: key cleared immediately after read\nfallback: navigate to /dashboard

Handoff -> Router: navigate({ to: '/catalog/abc' })
deactivate Handoff

@enduml
